127 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The objective of this project is to investigate the effectiveness of convolutional autoencoders for image based anomaly detection. Specifically, the project aims to design and compare multiple autoencoder architectures, including a baseline CAE, an improved CAE with skip connections, an attention-enhanced CAE, and a variational autoencoder. The goal is to analyze how architectural enhancements and probabilistic modeling impact reconstruction quality and anomaly detection performance.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
