130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 264 0 R
/E (The images were normalized to the range [0, 1] and reshaped for convolutional processing. Multiple convolutional autoencoder architectures were implemented, including a baseline model, an improved model with batch normalization and skip connections, an attention-enhanced model using self-attention, and a variational autoencoder with a probabilistic latent space and KL divergence regularization.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
