172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 267 0 R
/E (Future improvements could include combining attention mechanisms with variational autoencoders to benefit from both global feature modeling and probabilistic latent space constraints. Additionally, adversarial approaches such as GAN-based anomaly detection and transformer-based architectures could be explored to further enhance detection performance. Applying these models to higher-resolution and real-world industrial datasets would also provide more robust evaluation.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
